{"full":"hf:multimodalart/minimax-h3-audio-to-video","spaceId":"multimodalart/minimax-h3-audio-to-video","name":"MiniMax-H3 Audio to Video","source":"huggingface","description":"A first frame plus your own soundtrack, driving MiniMax-H3","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":48,"created":"2026-08-15T23:34:17.000Z","updated":"2026-08-16T15:09:32.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://multimodalart-minimax-h3-audio-to-video.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/multimodalart/minimax-h3-audio-to-video","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:29:47.278Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T07:29:47.278Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T07:29:47.278Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🔊","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["MiniMax-H3 denoises video and audio as one packed sequence, under two schedules (shift = 12 for video, shift = 3 for audio). In the fl2va workflow the keyframe anchors the leading video rows and the audio rows are drawn from noise like any other generated row, so the model invents its own soundtrack.","This Space hands it the audio rows instead. The upload is encoded by the model's own audio VAE, normalized the way the pipeline normalizes any soundtrack, and imposed on the audio rows at every step — so the video is denoised alongside a soundtrack it does not get to choose.","The first frame is optional. With one, the request is fl2va and the keyframe anchors the leading video rows. Without one it is t2va, the same audio conditioning against a shorter packed sequence — [text | target audio | target video], no keyframe condition block — and the canvas comes from the Canvas dropdown alone, since there is no aspect ratio to follow. None of the three conditioning blocks reads the keyframe, so the two branches share them; what differs is the core they sit in. Expect more seed-to-seed variance without the keyframe: that is the anchor doing its job in fl2va, not a fault…"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/multimodalart/minimax-h3-audio-to-video/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d69dbebbdff7f73178b9a5dc305a79cdfaa69f3a629db0997f7c0144f41f0917","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T05:40:21.659Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:29:47.358Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"MiniMax-H3 denoises video and audio as one packed sequence, under two schedules (shift = 12 for video, shift = 3 for audio). In the fl2va workflow the keyframe anchors the leading video rows and the audio rows are drawn from noise like any other generated row, so the model invents its own soundtrack.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/multimodalart/minimax-h3-audio-to-video/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"d69dbebbdff7f73178b9a5dc305a79cdfaa69f3a629db0997f7c0144f41f0917","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/multimodalart/minimax-h3-audio-to-video/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T07:29:47.358Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-16T15:09:32.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/multimodalart/minimax-h3-audio-to-video/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T01:12:24.041Z","hash":"d69dbebbdff7f73178b9a5dc305a79cdfaa69f3a629db0997f7c0144f41f0917","originalBytes":6461,"storedBytes":6461,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["audio","space","own","rows","step","video","one","which","minimax-h3","keyframe","model","soundtrack","base","lora","prompt","request","them","a2v","adaln","back","every","first","fl2va","turbo","what","against","checkpoint","clean","conditioner","conditioning","frame","get","instead","it.","locked","main","offsets","only","pruned","rather","rewrite","runs","same","steps","still","t2va","text","they","upload","adapter","after","alongside","anchors","any","app","between","blocks.py","both","canvas","carries","clip","comes","control","core"